      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "25 patients (2 normal and 23 coronary artery disease) were studied by 99m Tc gated blood pool scans at rest, with right atrial pacing, right atrial pacing and nitroglycerine, and finally nitroglycerine alone. Total and regional ejection fractions were measured and the induced and reversible asynergy with right atrial pacing and nitroglycerine was also assessed."},
